#: setup.php
msgid "Run every Doctor check in the background after the poller and record each check's status."
msgstr "Sebenzisa konke ukuhlolwa kwe-Doctor ngemuva ngemva kwe-poller futhi urekhode isimo sokuhlolwa ngakunye."

#: setup.php
msgid "Check Interval"
msgstr "Isikhawu Sokuhlolwa"

#: setup.php
msgid "How often the scheduled checks run."
msgstr "Ukuthi ukuhlolwa okuhleliwe kusebenza kangaki."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 15 Minutes"
msgstr "Njalo Ngemizuzu Engu-15"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Hour"
msgstr "Njalo Ngehora"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 6 Hours"
msgstr "Njalo Ngamahora Angu-6"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Day"
msgstr "Njalo Ngosuku"

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert Email Addresses"
msgstr "Amakheli E-imeyili Ezexwayiso"

#: setup.php
msgid "Comma-separated addresses to email when a check starts or stops failing. Leave empty to only log changes to the Cacti log."
msgstr "Amakheli ahlukaniswe ngokhefana okumele athunyelwe i-imeyili lapho ukuhlolwa kuqala noma kuyeka ukuhluleka. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze urekhode kuphela izinguquko kwilogi ye-Cacti."

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert on Warnings"
msgstr "Isaziso ngeZixwayiso"

#: setup.php
msgid "Also alert when a check moves into or out of a warning."
msgstr "Phinda uthumele isaziso uma ukuhlola kungena noma kuphuma esixwayisweni."

#: setup.php
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Imingcele"

#: setup.php
msgid "Poller Run Time Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Isixwayiso Sesikhathi Sokusebenza Kwe-Poller (amaphesenti)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the last main-poller run used this share of the polling interval. Runs that take the whole interval always fail."
msgstr "Xwayisa uma ukusebenza kokugcina kwe-poller enkulu kusebenzise lesi sabelo sesikhawu sokuhlola. Ukusebenza okuthatha sonke isikhawu kwehluleka njalo."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Isixwayiso Sesikhala Esivulekile Kudiski ye-RRA (amaphesenti)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Xwayisa uma isikhala esivulekile ohlelweni lwamafayela lwe-RRA sehla ngaphansi kwaleli phesenti."

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Yehluleka uma isikhala esivulekile ohlelweni lwamafayela lwe-RRA sehla ngaphansi kwaleli phesenti."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Failure (percent)"
msgstr "Ukwehluleka Kwesikhala Esivulekile Kudiski ye-RRA (amaphesenti)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Warning (seconds)"
msgstr "Isixwayiso Sokuphambuka Kwewashi (amasekhondi)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Xwayisa uma iwashi lesizindalwazi nelika-PHP ehluka ngokungaphezu kwalokhu."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Failure (seconds)"
msgstr "Ukwehluleka Kokuphambuka Kwewashi (amasekhondi)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Yehluleka uma iwashi lesizindalwazi nelika-PHP ehluka ngokungaphezu kwalokhu."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRD Stale Intervals"
msgstr "Izikhawu ze-RRD Ezingasavuselelwa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn after this many collection intervals without a file update (1 to 100)."
msgstr "Xwayisa ngemva kwalezi zikhawu zokuqoqwa kwedatha ngaphandle kokuvuselelwa kwefayela (1 kuya ku-100)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Additional disk-write delay for external caching (0 to 86400). Boost adds its own allowance."
msgstr "Ukubambezeleka okwengeziwe kokubhala kudiski kwe-caching yangaphandle (0 kuya ku-86400). I-Boost yengeza eyayo imvume."

#: setup.php
msgid "Deferred RRD Write Allowance (seconds)"
msgstr "Imvume Yokubhala kwe-RRD Okuhlehlisiwe (amasekhondi)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Cacti Log Size Warning (MB)"
msgstr "Isixwayiso Sosayizi Welogi ye-Cacti (MB)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the Cacti log grows beyond this size, which usually means log rotation is not running."
msgstr "Xwayisa uma ilogi ye-Cacti ikhula ngaphezu kwalolu sayizi, okuvame ukusho ukuthi ukujikeleza kwelogi akusebenzi."
